-- NOTE: countries uses `INSERT OR IGNORE` (SQLite syntax) because the source
-- data/countries.json has one duplicate country code (NO / Norway) — the second
-- copy is skipped. On Postgres/MySQL swap this for `INSERT ... ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING`
-- / `INSERT IGNORE` respectively.
-- ============================================================================

